{"version": "2.0", "class": "dataset", "label": "Expenditure on pensions by type of pension and means-testing", "source": "ESTAT", "updated": "2026-10-26T23:00:00+0100", "value": {"16": 3.28, "17": 3.28, "12": 3.28, "13": 3.28, "26": 2734.5, "27": 2965.65, "28": 9894.73, "29": 10767, "24": 12629.23, "25": 13732.65, "46": 289.49, "47": 200.01, "42": 289.49, "43": 200.01, "40": 0.38, "41": 0.58, "36": 0.38, "37": 0.58, "8": 942.59, "9": 1010.59, "10": 54982.99, "11": 59947.45, "6": 55925.59, "7": 60958.04, "34": 8305.73, "35": 8566.44, "30": 8305.73, "31": 8566.44, "2": 3677.09, "3": 3976.24, "4": 73476.6, "5": 79484.76, "0": 77153.69, "1": 83461}, "id": ["freq", "spdepb", "spdepm", "unit", "geo", "time"], "size": [1, 8, 3, 1, 1, 2], "dimension": {"freq": {"label": "Time frequency", "category": {"index": {"A": 0}, "label": {"A": "Annual"}}}, "spdepb": {"label": "Pension type", "category": {"index": {"TOTAL": 0, "OLD": 1, "AOLD": 2, "PART": 3, "DIS": 4, "SRV": 5, "ERRC": 6, "ERLM": 7}, "label": {"TOTAL": "Total", "OLD": "Old age pension", "AOLD": "Anticipated old age pension", "PART": "Partial pension", "DIS": "Disability pension", "SRV": "Survivors' pension", "ERRC": "Early retirement benefit due to reduced capacity to work", "ERLM": "Early retirement benefit for labour market reasons"}}}, "spdepm": {"label": "Means testing", "category": {"index": {"TOTAL": 0, "MT": 1, "NMT": 2}, "label": {"TOTAL": "Total", "MT": "Means-tested", "NMT": "Non means-tested"}}}, "unit": {"label": "Unit of measure", "category": {"index": {"MIO_EUR": 0}, "label": {"MIO_EUR": "Million euro"}}}, "geo": {"label": "Geopolitical entity (reporting)", "category": {"index": {"BE": 0}, "label": {"BE": "Belgium"}}}, "time": {"label": "Time", "category": {"index": {"2023": 0, "2024": 1}, "label": {"2023": "2023", "2024": "2024"}}}}, "extension": {"lang": "EN", "description": "<p>Expenditure on pensions measures public and, where relevant, private spending on cash pension benefits within social protection systems. Amounts are broken down by type of pension, including old-age, disability, survivors\u2019 and early retirement benefits, and by whether entitlements are means-tested or non means-tested. Values are expressed in monetary units, per inhabitant and as a percentage of Gross Domestic Product (GDP), using harmonized definitions to ensure cross\u2011country comparability.</p>", "id": "SPR_EXP_PENS", "agencyId": "ESTAT", "version": "1.0", "datastructure": {"id": "SPR_EXP_PENS", "agencyId": "ESTAT", "version": "60.0"}, "annotation": [{"type": "CREATED", "date": "2024-11-07T14:26:52+0100"}, {"type": "DISSEMINATION_DOI_XML", "title": "<adms:identifier xmlns:adms=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#\" xmlns:skos=\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core.html\" xmlns:dct=\"http://purl.org/dc/terms/\" xmlns:rdf=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"><adms:Identifier rdf:about=\"https://doi.org/10.2908/SPR_EXP_PENS\"><skos:notation rdf:datatype=\"http://purl.org/spar/datacite/doi\">10.2908/SPR_EXP_PENS</skos:notation><dct:creator rdf:resource=\"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/ESTAT\"/><dct:issued rdf:datatype=\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date\">2023-01-19</dct:issued></adms:Identifier></adms:identifier>"}, {"type": "DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK", "title": "text-category", "href": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_SPR_20241119.pdf"}, {"type": "DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK", "title": "text-category", "href": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_SPR_20241119.pdf"}, {"type": "DISSEMINATION_EXPLANATORY_LINK", "title": "text-category", "href": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser-backend/api/public/explanatory-notes/get/Info_note_SPR_20241119.pdf", "text": "Information note"}, {"type": "DISSEMINATION_OBJECT_TYPE", "title": "DATASET"}, {"type": "DISSEMINATION_TIMESTAMP_DATA", "date": "2026-10-26T23:00:00+0100"}, {"